*> Harness-only EXEC CICS RETRIEVE INTO(MQTM): trigger queue from $TRIGQ.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CICSRETR.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-MQTM.
   05 L-STRUCID PIC X(4).
   05 L-QNAME PIC X(48).
01 L-RESP PIC S9(8) BINARY.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-MQTM L-RESP.
    ACCEPT L-QNAME FROM ENVIRONMENT 'TRIGQ'
    MOVE 0 TO L-RESP
    GOBACK.
